  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partners Strategic Review Meeting for CGF Funded Projects 26/27</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Partners Strategic Review Meeting aims to bring together implementing partners and to review the progress, challenges, and strategic direction of CGF-funded projects. The meeting provides a platform to assess project performance against agreed objectives, share lessons learned, strengthen coordination among partners, and identify opportunities to improve implementation effectiveness and sustainability for the next project period in Nigeria.</narrative>
